{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n胡楓（修哥）在圈中人緣極佳，備受後輩尊敬，近日他在節目《一周星星》中，更親自爆出一個演唱會後台的感人秘密！修哥透露，在《修哥九五至尊無限楓騷演唱會》結束後，影帝張家輝與天王劉德華竟親自為他抹汗換衫，貼心舉動讓他至今依然非常感動，場面極之溫馨！\n</p>\n<h2>張家輝隔空抵死提問羅蘭姐</h2>\n<p>在節目的「你問我答」環節中，多位圈中好友隔空向修哥及羅蘭姐提問，當中影帝張家輝的問題最為「抵死」。他竟大膽問道：「羅蘭姐，你首次穿比堅尼拍攝時幾多歲？」盡顯其鬼馬本色。除了尖銳問題，張家輝亦關心修哥的舞技，問道：「修哥，你跳舞那麼厲害是哪裡學來的？」可見二人交情匪淺。</p>\n<h2>胡楓爆演唱會後台感人一幕</h2>\n<p>當晚最震撼的爆料，莫過於修哥憶述演唱會後台的感人一幕。他親證在《修哥九五至尊無限楓騷演唱會》完場後，兩位天王級後輩的暖心舉動。修哥感動地說：「演唱會最後尾我好攰，降到落後台嘅時候我成身汗，佢（張家輝）同劉德華就同我換衫同我抹汗，佢哋兩個對我非常之好。」簡單一句話，道盡了兩位天王對前輩的無限敬意與關懷。</p>\n<h2>修哥圈中好人緣備受後輩尊敬</h2>\n<p>張家輝與劉德華在後台的舉動，足以證明修哥在演藝圈中的崇高地位與超好人緣。兩位在影壇已是舉足輕重的人物，卻甘願在後台為前輩打點一切，親手服侍換衫抹汗，這份發自內心的尊重，絕非客套的場面話。這個溫馨的小故事，也讓外界一窺巨星們私下謙遜和尊師重道的一面，更突顯了修哥多年來深受愛戴的原因。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚兩大天王舉動暖心</h2>\n<p>修哥分享的這段溫馨往事，引來網民一面倒激讚。「嘩！劉德華同張家輝真係好尊重前輩！」「呢啲細節位先睇到人品，好感動。」「修哥真係圈中嘅福氣，個個都錫佢。」「影帝幫手抹汗，呢個畫面太珍貴！」「難怪修哥咁感動，真係好warm！兩位天王都係德藝雙馨嘅藝人！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_9830315396af922c0a422b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_9830315396af922c0a422b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7072594896af923261a328.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7072594896af923261a328.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_10667788826af9232ad5009.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_10667788826af9232ad5009.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_8382826506af923302c068.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_8382826506af923302c068.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5399398666af92335acdb0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5399398666af92335acdb0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:42:42.005302+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":998,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:30:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:36:50.909980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:36:15.732567+00:00","content_hash":"3ec0dfb84fc72f301713bae98dbce2141562fe04652b976e3460002494d026db","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}